{"arena": "Z", "t": 1792890825.1, "seq": 20, "op": "mutate", "model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "cost": 0.0007187200000000001, "parents": ["Z7"], "log": {"edges": [["progress", "goal_field", "call"]], "n_edges": 1, "editable": ["s3", "s4"], "llm": {"in": 403, "out": 1256, "cache_read": 5042, "cache_write": 0, "seconds": 6.4, "stop": "end_turn"}, "reply": "This mutation edits `progress` only. It keeps the distance-to-goal gain, but subtracts a penalty for each enemy within 2 tiles of the candidate step, weighted more heavily when my champion is below half health. `goal_field` is unchanged, since it can't assign keeps and recomputing a field per pass would cost too much fuel.\n\n```python\n@gene('s4', 'progress toward goals, minus a penalty for steps near enemies (heavier when hurt)', parents=['s4'])\ndef progress(t: Tile) -> Num:\n    f = goal_field()\n    here = at(f, me().pos)\n    there = at(f, t)\n    if there >= 1000000000:\n        return -1\n    near = count(dist(u.pos, t) <= 2 for u in enemies())\n    w = 1.5\n    if me().health_frac < 0.5:\n        w = 3\n    return here - there - w * near\n```"}, "error": "GenomeError: progress line 54: cannot assign to near", "birth": 11, "accepted": false, "fingerprint": null}
