{"arena": "Z", "t": 1792890918.1, "seq": 41, "op": "mutate", "model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "cost": 0.00049622, "parents": ["Z19"], "log": {"edges": [["progress", "goal_field", "call"]], "n_edges": 1, "editable": ["Z32b", "s3"], "llm": {"in": 508, "out": 790, "cache_read": 5042, "cache_write": 0, "seconds": 4.6, "stop": "end_turn"}, "genes_changed": ["Z32b"], "genes_added": [], "genes_removed": [], "added_sizes": [], "lines_changed": 3, "keeps_added": [], "pruned": []}, "error": null, "fingerprint": null, "birth": 24, "accepted": true, "name": "Z24", "species": "S10"}
{"arena": "Z", "t": 1792890920.3, "seq": 42, "op": "mutate", "model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "cost": 0.00047201999999999997, "parents": ["Z12"], "log": {"edges": [["score", "progress", "call"]], "n_edges": 1, "editable": ["s1", "s4"], "llm": {"in": 501, "out": 743, "cache_read": 5042, "cache_write": 0, "seconds": 4.1, "stop": "end_turn"}, "reply": "This mutation changes `progress` so a step toward the goals is penalised when it lands within 2 tiles of an enemy champion. The move score stays as it was, so the bot will still advance but will hesitate to walk into an enemy's reach.\n\n```python\n@gene(\"s4\", \"closer to goals, minus a penalty for stepping within 2 tiles of an enemy champion\", parents=[\"s4\"])\ndef progress(t: Tile) -> Num:\n    base = at(goal_field(), me().pos) - at(goal_field(), t)\n    threat = count(1 for u in enemies() if u.is_champion and dist(u.pos, t) <= 2)\n    return base - 3 * threat\n```"}, "error": "GenomeError: progress line 57: expected Bool, got Num", "birth": 24, "accepted": false, "fingerprint": null}
{"arena": "Z", "t": 1792890922.2, "seq": 43, "op": "mutate", "model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "cost": 0.00069842, "parents": ["Z10"], "log": {"edges": [["score", "progress", "call"], ["progress", "goal_field", "call"]], "n_edges": 2, "editable": ["s1", "s3", "s4"], "llm": {"in": 590, "out": 1178, "cache_read": 5042, "cache_write": 0, "seconds": 5.8, "stop": "end_turn"}, "reply": "This mutation changes the danger term in `progress` and makes move scores track progress size, so the bot prefers the best step rather than any step.\n\n```python\n@gene(\"s4\", \"closer step toward goals, penalty for enemy champions within 3 of the destination\", parents=[\"s4\"])\ndef progress(t: Tile) -> Num:\n    step = at(goal_field(), me().pos) - at(goal_field(), t)\n    danger = count(1 for u in enemies() if u.is_champion and dist(u.pos, t) <= 3)\n    return step * 2 - danger * 3\n\n\n@gene(\"s1\", \"value of doing this option now, moves ranked by progress\", parents=[\"s1\"])\ndef score(o: Option) -> Num:\n    if o.kind == PICK:\n        return 1\n    if o.kind == BUY:\n        return 100 if o.item == 6 else 0\n    if o.kind == RECALL:\n        return 90 if me().health_frac < 0.35 else 0\n    if o.kind == ATTACK:\n        if o.unit.is_champion:\n            return 80\n        return 60 if gems() == 0 else 0\n    if o.kind == TRIBUTE:\n        return 70\n    if o.kind == MOVE:\n        p = progress(o.tile)\n        return 40 + p * 5 if p > 0 else 0\n    return 0\n```"}, "error": "GenomeError: progress line 43: expected Bool, got Num", "birth": 24, "accepted": false, "fingerprint": null}
